OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright and feeling pleasant in any
OL,7,Fsunshine. Cloudier at times across
OL,8,FDumfries and Galloway. Breezy at times
OL,9,Faround the Solway coast, but winds
OL,10,Fmostly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe cloud thickening with
OL,13,Fpatchy rain at times during this
OL,14,Fevening and overnight, skies then
OL,15,Fclearing by dawn and turning rather
OL,16,Fchilly.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,19,Fwith sunny spells, although there will
OL,20,Fbe isolated showers. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
